# OpenSpec generator output: `openspec update` rewrites these files, they are
# generated rather than authored, so split advice does not apply. Exempt them
# from the global agent-size-guard (its 20 000-byte limit targets authored files).
.opencode/skills/openspec-*/** linguist-generated
.opencode/commands/** linguist-generated
# Kilo integration is OpenSpec generator output (planning-only subset): rewritten
# by `openspec update`, cannot be hand-split. Exempt it from the global
# agent-size-guard, whose 20 000-byte limit targets authored files.
.kilocode/skills/openspec-*/** linguist-generated
.kilo/command/** linguist-generated
